{"parse": {"title": "DAU-08", "pageid": 40840, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/DAU-07\" title=\"DAU-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">DAU-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">DAU</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.95.99.E5.B8.88.E4.B9.8B.E6.AD.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"教师之歌\">教师之歌</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 教师之歌</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Song for the Teacher</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1860108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>看，海燕！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩举起了一个皱皱巴巴的纸飞机，配合着哨声，在空中模拟飞行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子们从废纸堆里找出能用的所有，又将它们都变成海燕与青蛙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕索诺：</div><div>你这样折它是不对的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕索诺：</div><div>写了算术题的纸团是要拿来折斑点青蛙的，按一下就能跳的那种，你忘啦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>可青蛙已经有很多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">彼得森：</div><div>不要争吵！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"618601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"618601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-618601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-618601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">帕索诺：</div><div>我没吵，我只是在说，他用错纸了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼娜：</div><div>没关系，帕索诺。我们还有很多别的纸呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼娜：</div><div>这些更平整的，只有十字折痕的纸，我看就很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">尼娜：</div><div>阿夫西维同志，你用这个吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>谢谢你，尼娜同志！但我觉得，现在的海燕就很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>它坑坑洼洼的，还有些黑黢黢……它就像冲进矿场里的海燕，身上都是战斗的勋章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我想把它拿给维拉看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>维拉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不等同伴们回答，男孩就向走廊另一头正在谈话的大人们跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉留意到他的到来，下意识张开了手表示欢迎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不要在走廊上奔跑，阿夫西维同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>看！我的海燕！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>它是战斗过的海燕，飞了很远，很累，终于能停下来休息休息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>所以，我想让它停在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皱巴巴的纸飞机停在了维拉的手心里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>哦，谢谢。谢谢你，阿夫西维同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/HeadIconSmall-308710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我保证，它会在这里得到一个飞行英雄应有的待遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-307801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>好的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/93/HeadIconSmall-308701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>那我就先把它收起来，夹在本子里了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>好了，这样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>既然你来了，我正好想问，你们都做好去第一防线学校的准备了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>需要准备什么？我不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>比如，你想带上什么东西，或者了解一下那里的课程，这类准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>也许尼娜会想知道那里的环境如何。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>除了我的朋友们，我什么也不需要。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>帕索诺也是这么说的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>很好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你们都已经是勇敢的小同志，请保护好自己，好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>第一防线学校可以说是这个世界上最安全的地方之一了，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>您完全不用担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>孩子们总得学会自己保护自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我甚至只是个美术老师，本来也没法永远陪着他们，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>维拉，你不去学校吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>你是人鱼，你不去学校……那你要回到海里去了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>讶异的表情出现在了维拉脸上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>什么？不，不是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>如果你变成泡沫了，那我还能见到你吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>一团泡沫，要怎样才能变回维拉呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不不不，不是那样的，孩子。我不会——变成泡沫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>可是你说，“永恒的灵魂”只是一个名字。你没有“永恒的灵魂”，人鱼公主也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>帕索诺说人鱼公主变成了泡沫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>所以你也会——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我不会的，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“永恒的灵魂”作为一个可以被任何人赋予的名词，对个人来说，是没有意义的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>一个看不见摸不着的东西，并不会让我突然变成泡沫……即使我游回了海里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>更何况，我不会回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>那这究竟是什么呢？什么都是“永恒的灵魂”，但也什么都不是吗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维拉弯下腰，与男孩对上视线，以便能更好地传达自己的想法。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_8_at_weila.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_8_at_weila\"><img alt=\"1_8_at_weila\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/Cg-1_8_at_weila.png/600px-Cg-1_8_at_weila.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/Cg-1_8_at_weila.png/900px-Cg-1_8_at_weila.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/Cg-1_8_at_weila.png/1200px-Cg-1_8_at_weila.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>起先，我也以为是那样的，它可以被轻易地指认。我所坚信的一切都可以是它，又什么都不是它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我看见小镇弥合了不同人之间的隔阂乃至仇恨，于是，我便把这种可能认作“永恒”，将人的坚毅辨识成“灵魂”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>而现在……我知道不是那样的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307813.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307813.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307813.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307813.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307813.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307813.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307813.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307813.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>那什么才是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>是你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>我们？我就是“永恒的灵魂”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>不是那样的。不是你一个人，是“你们”。你们是下一代，是族群的存续，是不会被错置的未来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>只要有你们，那我们这些之前的人，就不会像阁楼上的酱菜罐子一样被遗忘。只要有你们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>“永恒的灵魂”就存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>所以，这东西对于我一个人来说，是不存在的，可以随意命名的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>就像我的神秘术。彼得森同学说的那个沙发，记得吗？只过了一会儿，它就变回木头椅子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>那毕竟只是个戏法，与“永恒”相去甚远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>感谢你的补充，命名日先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>我只是看阿夫西维同学的眼神都有点儿恍惚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>唉，我可能的确说得太复杂了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>你能听明白吗，阿夫西维同志？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩沉默着，似乎又陷入了自己的世界里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又或者，他只是在尝试理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/HeadIconSmall-307812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>可是就算我能看见你的灵魂，这也不算吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>阿夫西维同志，请回神了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我想，应该没有人能看见另一个人的灵魂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307814.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-307814.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307814.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307814.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-307814.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307814.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/86/HeadIconSmall-307814.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307814.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>可我看到你的灵魂了，是金色的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着男孩指向自己身后的手，维拉回过头去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗扇之外，日头已经升得很高了，阳光洒进开放走廊，把青年女性身体的廓形拉得很长很长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>日光的澄金又勾勒这廓形，四周地面光滑如水银，仿佛下一秒，这金色的影就会向走廊的更深处流去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308713.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308713.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-308713.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308713.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金色轮廓指向的尽头，一个熟悉的身影出现了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-307711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-307711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-307711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>找到了——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxin\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxin\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxin.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>维拉女士，你真的在这里！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuizoulang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuizoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuizoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>啊，还有小阿夫西维，以及一位我不认识的先生——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-307701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>你们也好啊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-623710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-623710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/HeadIconSmall-623710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">命名日：</div><div>啊，你好。你就是北方哨歌女士吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">北方哨歌：</div><div>是的，没错！接下来我会在远东分部这边，筹备一场演讲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿夫西维：</div><div>北方哨歌！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>我也很高兴见到你，北方哨歌同志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>在孩子们去学校之前，他们一定很高兴能再走进你的课堂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>现在……就让我们走吧。去和大家站在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维拉：</div><div>和以前一样。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "DAU-08"}}